{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"GHSA-m8g6-vrr2-x7ff","published":"2026-06-25T09:31:23Z","modified":"2026-11-03T21:45:42.054835356Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-56130"],"summary":"Apache Shiro's \"remember me\" cookie age is not verified on the server.","details":"\"Remember me\" cookie age is not verified on the server. This potentially allows an attacker to intercept a valid cookie and reuse it indefinitely, even after the configured expiration time has passed.\nThis issue affects all Apache Shiro versions from 1.2.4 through 2.x, and 3.0.0-alpha-1, only when RememberMe functionality is enabled.\n\n\nUpgrade to version 3.0.0 or later, which fixes the issue.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"org.apache.shiro:shiro-core","ecosystem":"Maven","purl":"pkg:maven/org.apache.shiro/shiro-core"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"1.2.4"},{"fixed":"3.0.0"}]}],"versions":["1.10.0","1.10.1","1.11.0","1.12.0","1.13.0","1.2.4","1.2.5","1.2.6","1.3.0","1.3.1","1.3.2","1.4.0","1.4.0-RC2","1.4.1","1.4.2","1.5.0","1.5.1","1.5.2","1.5.3","1.6.0","1.7.0","1.7.1","1.8.0","1.9.0","1.9.1","2.0.0","2.0.0-alpha-1","2.0.0-alpha-2","2.0.0-alpha-3","2.0.0-alpha-4","2.0.1","2.0.2","2.0.3","2.0.4","2.0.5","2.0.6","2.1.0","2.2.0","2.2.1","3.0.0-alpha-1"],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/06/GHSA-m8g6-vrr2-x7ff/GHSA-m8g6-vrr2-x7ff.json"}},{"package":{"name":"org.apache.shiro:shiro-web","ecosystem":"Maven","purl":"pkg:maven/org.apache.shiro/shiro-web"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"1.2.4"},{"fixed":"3.0.0"}]}],"versions":["1.10.0","1.10.1","1.11.0","1.12.0","1.13.0","1.2.4","1.2.5","1.2.6","1.3.0","1.3.1","1.3.2","1.4.0","1.4.0-RC2","1.4.1","1.4.2","1.5.0","1.5.1","1.5.2","1.5.3","1.6.0","1.7.0","1.7.1","1.8.0","1.9.0","1.9.1","2.0.0","2.0.0-alpha-1","2.0.0-alpha-2","2.0.0-alpha-3","2.0.0-alpha-4","2.0.1","2.0.2","2.0.3","2.0.4","2.0.5","2.0.6","2.1.0","2.2.0","2.2.1","3.0.0-alpha-